# Abmiti core

Halal-friendly personal finance tracker. Canonical agent doc: `AGENTS.md`. Setup: `README.md`.

- Packages: `client/` (Vite React, basename `/abmiti/`), `server/` (Express `/api/v1`), `mobile/` (Flutter WebView only).
- Dual DB: `I*Repository` in `server/src/shared/types/repositories.ts`; implement Mongo and MySQL; wire `container.ts`.
- No public admin signup. Payments: server-side SSLCommerz verification and fixed prices.
- New UI strings: English and Bengali in `client/src/i18n.ts`.
- Brand Tailwind tokens: `terra`, `sage`, `mustard`, `ink`, `paper`.
- Never commit `.env`, keystores, or gateway secrets.
